Subject: [PATCH] fix(gate): discover known failures from test markers

Replace the cut skip list with source markers and pin the expected assertion line.
Check marked issue states in both release commands.
Add marker, review, and regression rules.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

